3609" :question/problem "The row echelon form matrix $M$ is given below. What are the pivot columns of $M?$\n\n$$\nM=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 2 & 0 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 4 & -1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 7 & 3 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 0\\end{bmatrix}\n$$" :question/worked-solution "Remember that the pivots of a matrix in row echelon form are the first non-zero entries in each row of the matrix.\n\nWe can see that $M$ has $3$ pivots in the $1$st, $2$nd, and $3$rd columns:\n\n$$\nM=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 2 & 0 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 4 & -1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 7 & 3 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 0\\end{bmatrix}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186342031 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186124477 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "488c9762-554b-5ea6-b414-ce6cbde9bbd1" :knowledge-point/title "Finding the Pivot Columns of a Matrix in Row Echelon Form"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0f73df29-a20e-5ab6-befc-2452f29cbb4e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$1$st, $2$nd, $3$rd, and $4$th" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186339271} {:answer/id #uuid "2e981f00-0b4c-54f5-b56f-5944c17425a2" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$1$st and $3$rd only" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186339539} {:answer/id #uuid "3e778f3f-3d93-5621-b021-980061e030a7" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$1$st, $2$nd, and $4$th only" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186339689} {:answer/id #uuid "e5b0ec78-b45c-59db-97ab-9fe858c90de6" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$1$st, $3$rd, and $4$th only" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186341159} {:answer/id #uuid "f67e99a8-6dea-5baa-9f03-0c6715e1a464" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$1$st, $2$nd, and $3$rd only" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186341309}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "e5b0ec78-b45c-59db-97ab-9fe858c90de6" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 175